{"unit_id":"tag:03X7:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n为完整起见，我们陈述并证明所考虑的上同调群（cohomology groups）在部分（partial）论域（universe）的选取下的不变性（invariance）。我们将在下面证明小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos）的不变性（invariance），见引理 <REF_0001>。本引理中使用的记号和术语见拓扑（Topologies）节 <REF_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"partial","target_term":"部分"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"partial","target_term":"部分","context":"部分论域的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小拓扑斯的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
