{"unit_id":"tag:04HP:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拓扑斯（topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是范畴（category），由层（sheaves）组成，取值于集合（sets），在一个景（site）上，见景（Sites）定义 <REF_0001>。因此习惯使用“平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos），对于概形（scheme）”这一说法，来指范畴（category），由层（sheaves）组成，在小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）上，属于一个概形（scheme）。以下给出正式定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小景的限定，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
