{"unit_id":"tag:04HP:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，小（small）Zariski 拓扑斯（topos），对于 <MATH_0001>，就是范畴（category），由层（sheaves）组成，取值于集合（sets），在底层拓扑空间（topological space）上，属于 <MATH_0002>，见拓扑（Topologies）引理 <REF_0001>。小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos）不依赖于构造小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）时所作的选取，而一般而言，大（big）拓扑斯（topoi）确实依赖这些选取。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n事实上，大（big）或小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）拓扑斯（topos）只依赖于全子范畴（full subcategory），在 <MATH_0003> 或 <MATH_0004> 中，由仿射概形（affines）组成，见拓扑（Topologies）引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>。例如，我们将在下面引理的证明中使用这一点。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小景或小拓扑斯的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_ter